2.
Definitions
.-In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(i)
"Committee" means the Narcotic Drugs and Psychotropic Substances Consultative Committee;
(ii)
"the rule" means the rules framed under the Narcotic Drugs and Psychotropic Substances Act, 1985 (
61 of 1985
);
(iii)
"the Act" means the Narcotic Drugs and Psychotropic Substances Act, 1985 (
61 of 1985
);
(iv)
"official members" mean members, who are appointed to the Committee by virtue of their official positions under the
Central Government;
(v)
"non-official members" mean the members other than official members;
(vi)
words and expressions used herein and not defined, but defined in the Act and the Rules framed thereunder shall have
the meanings respectively assigned to them in the Act.
Chapter II
General Rules
